#. module: payment_razorpay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_razorpay.payment_provider_form_razorpay
msgid ""
"You are currently connected to Razorpay through the credentials method, "
"which is\n"
"                    deprecated. Click the \"Connect\" button above to use "
"the recommended OAuth\n"
"                    method."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນທ່ານກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Razorpay ຜ່ານວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີທີ່\n"
"                    ຖືກຍົກເລີກການນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາກົດປຸ່ມ \"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່\" ຢູ່ຂ້າງເທິງເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີ "
"OAuth\n"
"                    ທີ່ແນະນຳ."

#. module: payment_razorpay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_razorpay/models/payment_token.py:0
msgid ""
"You can not pay amounts greater than %(currency_symbol)s %(max_amount)s with "
"this payment method"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຊຳລະເງິນຈຳນວນທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ %(currency_symbol)s %(max_amount)s ດ້ວຍວິທີການຊຳລະເ"
"ງິນນີ້ໄດ້"

#. module: payment_razorpay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_razorpay/models/payment_provider.py:0
msgid "Your Razorpay webhook was successfully set up!"
msgstr "Webhook ຂອງ Razorpay ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດແລ້ວ!"

#. module: payment_razorpay
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/payment_razorpay/models/payment_transaction.py:0
msgid ""
"Your last payment %s will soon be processed. Please wait up to 24 hours "
"before trying again, or use another payment method."
msgstr ""
"ການຊຳລະເງິນຄັ້ງລ່າສຸດຂອງທ່ານ %s ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການປະມວນຜົນໃນໄວໆນີ້. ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າສູງສຸດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈ"
"ະລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ, ຫຼື ນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນອື່ນ."
